description:
Design a four-bit binary counter that increments on each positive clock edge. When the reset signal is asserted, the counter resets to zero. The counter will wrap around to zero again after reaching the maximum value of 15 (1111 in binary), creating a continuous count from 0 to 15.
module top_module(
input clk,reset,
output reg [3:0] counter
    );

code:
module top_module(
input clk,reset,
output reg [3:0] counter
    );always @(posedge clk)   
begin  
    if(reset)
        counter <= 4'b0000;
    else if(counter != 4'b1111)
        counter <= counter + 1;
    else
        counter <= 4'b0000;        
end    
endmodule

