description:
Design a circuit that converts a 3-bit binary input into its corresponding 3-bit Gray code output. The module uses a combinational logic approach to determine the Gray code representation based on the input binary values, ensuring that only one bit changes at a time between consecutive values, which is essential for minimizing errors in digital communication systems.
